  "content": "<h2>СosmoCat 連結</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Cosmoocat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/976428cc3628909cd4b82eeadfa96012a4acc87a.png\" alt=\"yt\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/34Wy4VmD9m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cb29e96bf480ff4df0c955440ca77e289b5b3613.png\" alt=\"ds\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/LovelyBunny11/motleyfins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9a5e803ad78e0cb87306be48973501582c8e49c8.png\" alt=\"gh\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fmotley-fins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/62ad04189ed2708a39eb8f72fb3caf1acf6a4d20.png\" alt=\"cf\"></a></p><h2>LovelyBunny 連結</h2><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5cjKPwmp36\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1547164/description_06f251e9-c715-469b-bc18-a2a8d65a66f8.png\" alt=\"ds_l\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a></p><h1>關於</h1><p>更新水生生物群落，新增方塊與一種新生物！</p><h1>給模組包創作者</h1><p>您可以自由在您的模組包中使用我們的模組。<br>不過，如果您製作的是付費模組包，則需事先取得我們的許可。</p><h1>特色</h1><p>鸚鵡魚</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>鸚鵡魚是一種在溫暖海洋中生成的新熱帶魚。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>餵食鸚鵡魚珊瑚，牠們會掉落一些白沙。</li>\n<li>您可以食用鸚鵡魚，但牠們毒性極強。</li>\n<li>9種顏色。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6d44243c-1c06-40c3-a6e3-1d7ba6e3e4c4.png\" alt=\"p_parrotfish\" width=\"411\" height=\"357\"></p>\n</div>",
